## Pre-PR Checklist

- [ ] **CHANGELOG entry included in the PR diff** under `## [Unreleased]` (not retroactively on main)
- [ ] **README updated** if user-facing behavior changed (new flags, commands, defaults, config)
{% if has_prfaq %}- [ ] **prfaq.tex updated** if the change shifts product direction or validates/invalidates a risk
{% endif %}{% if has_design_md %}- [ ] **DESIGN.md updated** if architecture, module responsibilities, or design decisions changed
{% endif %}- [ ] **Quality gates pass** — `{{ quality_gates_command }}`
